# Normalise line endings to LF, in the repository and in the working tree.
# Git for Windows ships core.autocrlf=true in its system config, so without
# this a checkout here produces CRLF files; a later scripted edit then leaves
# a file with both, which Plugin Check reports as Internal.LineEndings.Mixed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip  binary
